      "writtenOn": "2020-02-04T02:57:27Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "if it\u0027s ok to lose non-packet data when uart is in packet mode, can we then just never copy to uart_in-\u003ebuffer[]?\nI.e.\n#ifdef BOARD_CR50\n  while (ec_comm_is_uart_in_packet_mode(uart) \u0026\u0026 uartn_rx_available(uart)) {\n    ec_comm_process_packet(uartn_read_char(uart));\n  }\n#endif\n  while ((count !\u003d q_room) \u0026\u0026 uartn_rx_available(uart)) {\n    uart_in-\u003ebuffer[tail \u0026 mask] \u003d uartn_read_char(uart);\n    tail++;\n    count++;\n  }\n\nIf it\u0027s not ok to lose data, then let\u0027s do\n\n  while (uartn_rx_available(uart)) {\n    uint8_t ch \u003d uartn_read_char(uart);\n#ifdef BOARD_CR50\n    if (ec_comm_is_uart_in_packet_mode(uart) \u0026\u0026 ec_comm_process_packet(uart))\n      continue;\n#endif\n    if (count \u003d\u003d q_room)\n      break;\n    uart_in-\u003ebuffer[tail \u0026 mask] \u003d uartn_read_char(uart);\n    tail++;\n    count++;\n  }\n\nif you need optimization\n\n#ifdef BOARD_CR50\n  while (uartn_rx_available(uart)) {\n#else\n  while ((count !\u003d q_room) \u0026\u0026 uartn_rx_available(uart)) {\n#endif\n    uint8_t ch \u003d uartn_read_char(uart);\n#ifdef BOARD_CR50\n    if (ec_comm_is_uart_in_packet_mode(uart) \u0026\u0026 ec_comm_process_packet(ch))\n      continue; /* can cache in_packet_mode if it can\u0027t change while in this loop */\n    if (count \u003d\u003d q_room)\n      break;\n#endif\n    uart_in-\u003ebuffer[tail \u0026 mask] \u003d ch;\n    tail++;\n    count++;\n  }",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 188,
        "startChar": 37,
        "endLine": 189,
        "endChar": 26
      },
      "revId": "fea5a4a342eaef04fa01b12d421da222fb2200d2",
